172
00:22:40,950 --> 00:22:42,130
There's great benefit to them.

173
00:22:42,650 --> 00:22:42,931
Great.

174
00:22:43,931 --> 00:22:45,531
But it's the opposite, isn't it?

175
00:22:46,271 --> 00:22:53,232
All of these disturbing thoughts have only brought us dissatisfaction and further dissatisfaction.

176
00:22:53,312 --> 00:22:55,993
Accordingly, we've been brought low as we read.

177
00:22:56,633 --> 00:23:00,497
And this is simply through failing to tame the unruly mind.

178
00:23:01,318 --> 00:23:12,048
Accordingly, it is imperative before engaging in the practice of sitting meditation to consider then the faults of perpetually remaining under the influence of discursive thought.

179
00:23:12,828 --> 00:23:19,354
Thoughts then that have only brought us dissatisfaction and will only lead to further dissatisfaction.

180
00:23:20,135 --> 00:23:20,155
.

