259
00:35:05,058 --> 00:35:19,752
Having placed the image of the Buddha in front of you, then it is useful to reflect upon the qualities of the Buddha.

260
00:35:20,833 --> 00:35:30,162
Accordingly, look at the image with admiration as if it were the Tathagata's actual form and reflect thus.

261
00:35:32,060 --> 00:35:45,109
Like an Udumbara flower, which appears in this world only every few hundred years, the Tathagata arises from the cause of boundless accumulation of merit and wisdom beyond imagining.

262
00:35:46,630 --> 00:35:55,376
Since the Tathagata is fully adorned with the 32 excellent marks and the 80 excellent signs, seeing him is without disharmony.

263
00:35:56,657 --> 00:36:09,891
In the world of gods, the extremely clear and steadfast noble rupakayas of form bodies are seen in common by all the sentient beings of that world at that time.

264
00:36:11,292 --> 00:36:15,814
These forms of the awakened one, Rupakayas, also teach the Dharma there.

265
00:36:16,514 --> 00:36:20,356
And they display all kinds of miracles for the benefit of those to be tamed.

266
00:36:20,736 --> 00:36:33,662
They also perform various actions, including staying, departing, getting up, sleeping, and bringing immeasurable sentient beings, sources of virtue, to fruition.

267
00:36:34,742 --> 00:36:55,438
Our teacher, Shakyamuni, the lion of the Shakyas, was born into the royal line of the Shakyas and eventually attained enlightenment, after which he taught the Dharma to Bodhisattvas, Sravakas, and many other gatherings of beings at Vulture's Peak and elsewhere.

268
00:36:56,518 --> 00:37:03,741
While keeping in mind these qualities and attributes, think, this is what the Tathagata's form is like in shape and appearance.

269
00:37:04,722 --> 00:37:16,166
The Tathagata is the embodiment of discipline, of samadhi, of supreme knowledge, complete freedom, the gathering of the wisdom and seeing of complete liberation and so on.

270
00:37:16,866 --> 00:37:20,488
He is endowed with immaculate qualities that are beyond imagining.

271
00:37:21,068 --> 00:37:27,192
and cannot be adequately conveyed even unto the very limits of space itself.

272
00:37:28,432 --> 00:37:31,314
He closely embraces all of us with his great love.

273
00:37:31,915 --> 00:37:38,779
For our sake he underwent immeasurable hardships, as you should learn from the supportive teachings for the treasury of blessings.

274
00:37:39,519 --> 00:37:45,883
These tell, for instance, of how the Brahmin, Sudaraja, generated bodhicitta in such ways

275
00:37:46,603 --> 00:37:59,148
that for three immeasurable aeons, practicing the six parameters, he gathered inconceivable and inexpressible accumulations of merit and wisdom, and was freed from all obscuration.

276
00:37:59,988 --> 00:38:05,991
By conquering the four Maras, he completely perfected all excellent qualities without exception.

277
00:38:06,751 --> 00:38:17,639
And having obtained the Kairav, the great wisdom of omniscience, he became the refuge, protector, and friend of all sentient beings until the end of time.

278
00:38:18,780 --> 00:38:24,084
The virtues of recalling the unsurpassable Bhagavan, the transcendent conqueror,

279
00:38:24,824 --> 00:38:39,431
paying homage to him, uttering his name, seeing his bodily form, and, closer to home, resting the mind one pointedly upon it, and so on, no matter how small, will become the cause for supreme awakening.

280
00:38:40,211 --> 00:38:52,417
And accordingly then, one should reflect upon the qualities of the Buddha, thinking, since this is due to the power of the Tathagata's aspirations and inconceivable wisdom, how fortunate we are.

281
00:38:53,357 --> 00:38:58,018
Hereby, generate great faith by recalling the qualities of the Buddha.

282
00:39:19,128 --> 00:39:19,148
.

283
00:39:19,188 --> 00:39:19,228
.

284
00:39:19,248 --> 00:39:19,268
.

285
